# An allowlist: the image gets the app, the project's defaults and the sample article, nothing
# else (no .env files, no local articles, no tests).
*
!bin/
!cli.py
!config.yaml
!core/
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!project/
!requirements.txt
!samples/
!ui/

# inside what is allowed: never the articles (they live on the volume), caches, or local state
project/output
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.lock
**/.env*
ui/jobs.json
**/node_modules
